      <p><seg source="#source-729-755">一、金子弐両也。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-755-884">右者下拙儀讃州地方ニ罷越候ニ付、金子入用ニ付借用候事実正ニ候。返弁之儀当暮限壱割五歩之</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-890-941"><seg source="#source-884-890">利足</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-914-926">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-941-974">を加、元利共必然皆済可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-974-986">レ</note><seg source="#source-986-992">致、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-992-1016"><rb>仍</rb><rt>（よつて）</rt></ruby><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1016-1028">レ</note><seg source="#source-1028-1043">之借用始末</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1043-1097"><rb><seg source="#source-1046-1049">如</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1049-1061">レ</note><seg source="#source-1061-1064">件</seg></rb><rt>（くだんのごとく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1097-1105">候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1105-1158" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1126-1158">文久辛酉歳十月十四日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1158-1219" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-1176-1188">坂本龍馬</seg><g ref="#gaiji-58-12" source="#source-1188-1217"/></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1219-1249" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1240-1249">良助殿</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
